{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-npc-p11525-22b647ef4e6006fa0356","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","text":"잠깐의 침묵 후, 앞에 있던 「시계 소년」이 갑자기 한 초췌한 남자로 변한다","speaker":"","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"슬픔","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["2294958834378795533"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-8897bd5d881ed2eb6f1b","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","text":"후… 정말 미안한데, 지금 몸이 좀 안 좋네. 잠깐만 쉬어도 될까?","speaker":"월프","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"슬픔","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16868337463600637442"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3882582546787294271","5992772262401824057","15747282712666117063"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-c0ade5885cd8ca124710","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","text":"하아… 이해해 줘서 고마워……","speaker":"월프","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"슬픔","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10484484294894299270"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3882582546787294271","5992772262401824057","15747282712666117063"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-848e7888c5b1f1a387fa","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","text":"이대로 퇴근을 하시겠다?","speaker":"","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"슬픔","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["1120413291079281560"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-650e5fa688b10150070c","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","text":"미안… 책임감 없다는 건 알지만, 잠깐 신선한 공기를 마시고 싶어서……","speaker":"월프","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"슬픔","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["597890631573650012"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3882582546787294271","5992772262401824057","15747282712666117063"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-2597f2d8a87342eac9ea","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","text":"지친 남자는 다시 침묵에 빠졌다. 그의 표정은 생기가 없고 눈빛은 탁하다","speaker":"","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"슬픔","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["2275588502102999516"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-980f47257cc855ba8c51","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","text":"그의 안 좋은 안색이 동정심을 불러일으킨 것인지, 아니면 그의 낙담한 모습에 마음이 움직인 건지 당신은 갑자기 그와 대화가 하고 싶어졌다","speaker":"","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"슬픔","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["17326988107843960940"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-77de11e44fb82ee502b7","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","text":"그래서 당신은 가까이 다가가 그의 축 처진 어깨를 가볍게 두드렸다","speaker":"","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"슬픔","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["6520137388406654646"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-da5197b240015fb02b42","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","text":"응? 아, 미, 미안. 못 알아챘네… 만화 캐릭터와 놀고 싶은 거지? 저쪽에 다른 연기자가 있어……","speaker":"월프","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"슬픔","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3902590838906534048"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3882582546787294271","5992772262401824057","15747282712666117063"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-6542d3b337f0b527ad8c","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","text":"하하… 내 푸념이 듣고 싶은 거야? 휴… 아직도 안 가고 있으니 듣고 싶은 거라고 생각할게","speaker":"월프","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"슬픔","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["8657226166963277052"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3882582546787294271","5992772262401824057","15747282712666117063"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-105c5f1fde2038bb8955","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","text":"나는, 그러니까… 사람들이 날 멍청하다고 생각하는 것 알아…. 이 나이 먹고 꿈만 믿고 살아갈 수 있다고 생각하는 사람은 없을 테니 말이야","speaker":"월프","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"슬픔","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["17170137323706618841"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3882582546787294271","5992772262401824057","15747282712666117063"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-121ca610320bfa17ce18","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","text":"…그때… 난 은퇴 후에 남들이 말한 것처럼 과거의 유명세를 이용해 광고를 받아 돈을 벌지 않았지. 대신 가장 좋아하는 시계 소년을 위해 페나코니에 와서 마스코트 연기자가 되었어","speaker":"월프","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"슬픔","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["18367360037876028801"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3882582546787294271","5992772262401824057","15747282712666117063"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-fa827a3101ca9ccf0a9f","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","text":"그런데 이 일은 내가 생각했던 것과 완전히 달랐지…. 더 큰 문제는 호텔 숙박비로 재산의 대부분을 다 썼는데, 지금의 몸 상태로는 경기장으로 돌아갈 수도 없다는 거야……","speaker":"월프","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"슬픔","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16928099260019840207"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3882582546787294271","5992772262401824057","15747282712666117063"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-7a5fb2f17745c4705668","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","text":"후회하냐고 묻는다면——나도 잘 모르겠어, 하하. 내가 아는 건, 지금의 난 소다수 씨가 없는 시계 소년처럼 기운을 못 차리고, 열정을 불태우지도 못한다는 것뿐이지……","speaker":"월프","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"슬픔","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["9858168198164185065"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3882582546787294271","5992772262401824057","15747282712666117063"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-a52eaf5fd415745b3ea2","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","text":"아, 혼자 말을 너무 많이 했네. 지겨웠지? 내 푸념을 들어줘서 고마워. 기분이… 많이 나아졌어","speaker":"월프","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"슬픔","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["8612401690879345955"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3882582546787294271","5992772262401824057","15747282712666117063"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-8298db4aee9fe245c7bf","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","text":"잠깐의 침묵 후, 「시계 소년」이 또다시 당신 앞에 나타났다","speaker":"","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"슬픔","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["4137818642505149435"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-cd3dbc527a6016e6085c","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","text":"친구, 시계 소년이 도와줄게, 째깍!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"슬픔","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["5465563681284253669","744801753959962430","14217452912576758276"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-e254b99588e17fd25d2b","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","text":"친구, 시계 소년이 도와줄게, 째…","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"슬픔","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["4370483567528466735"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-3f06c8e07993c463ea7d","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","text":"……","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"슬픔","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["8669905099193931704","7979957216959182619"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-971bf5b1c6abbda6fe74","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","text":"미안, 잠깐만 쉴게. 아주 잠깐만……","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"슬픔","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["8261509131051843222"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-e74237ad8c671ee6d18a","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"s392cdaaefb343116","text":"……","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"슬픔","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["8669905099193931704","7979957216959182619"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"npc-p11525","title":"「시계 소년」","page":"「钟表小子」","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-npc-p11525-22b647ef4e6006fa0356","rowId":"other-npc-p11525-22b647ef4e6006fa0356","missionId":"npc-p11525","mission":"「시계 소년」","sceneId":"s392cdaaefb343116","scene":"슬픔","contextId":"wiki-context-2300340ac994e0904acd6a76","page":"「钟表小子」","revision":64190,"location":[1,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":[],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-8897bd5d881ed2eb6f1b","rowId":"other-npc-p11525-8897bd5d881ed2eb6f1b","missionId":"npc-p11525","mission":"「시계 소년」","sceneId":"s392cdaaefb343116","scene":"슬픔","contextId":"wiki-context-6af50594f78347d6682763c6","page":"「钟表小子」","revision":64190,"location":[2,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":[],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-c0ade5885cd8ca124710","rowId":"other-npc-p11525-c0ade5885cd8ca124710","missionId":"npc-p11525","mission":"「시계 소년」","sceneId":"s392cdaaefb343116","scene":"슬픔","contextId":"wiki-context-40653611dc6d89505f66b017","page":"「钟表小子」","revision":64190,"location":[2,1,"reply",0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":["696b69fccc5a-0"],"nextIds":[],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-848e7888c5b1f1a387fa","rowId":"other-npc-p11525-848e7888c5b1f1a387fa","missionId":"npc-p11525","mission":"「시계 소년」","sceneId":"s392cdaaefb343116","scene":"슬픔","contextId":"wiki-context-40653611dc6d89505f66b017","page":"「钟表小子」","revision":64190,"location":[2,1,"option",1,0],"conditions":[],"branch":["696b69fccc5a-1"],"nextIds":["other-npc-p11525-650e5fa688b10150070c"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-650e5fa688b10150070c","rowId":"other-npc-p11525-650e5fa688b10150070c","missionId":"npc-p11525","mission":"「시계 소년」","sceneId":"s392cdaaefb343116","scene":"슬픔","contextId":